1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,780
I got a ticket for a sweet afternoon

2
00:00:03,860 --> 00:00:08,100
The sun is going down, but it's coming up soon

3
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:12,100
So pull your chairs in close tonight and gather round me here

4
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:16,340
There's a few more things I need to say while the sky is clear

5
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:19,780
I never had a fortune, I never wore a crown

6
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:23,860
Just a whole life's worth of living that I'm passing down

7
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:27,620
So I'm handing you my stories and the lessons that I learned

8
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:32,420
All the roads I had to walk and the corners that I turned

9
00:00:32,660 --> 00:00:34,340
I live on through you

10
00:00:34,340 --> 00:00:36,340
In the way you hold your ground

11
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:40,100
In the way you take a hit and never make a sound

12
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:44,180
When you're sitting 'round the table telling stories like we do

13
00:00:44,180 --> 00:00:46,020
You'll hear me in the laughter

14
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:48,020
I live on through you

15
00:00:48,020 --> 00:00:50,500
I live on through you
